        <mxCell id="T5EDZcPU9q_wp7y4ELcz-39" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reduce development time by providing reusability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;More focus on the business problem than the code.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Less refactoring due to strict and consistent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;template adapted by all team&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Easy maintenace and bug fixes with custom logger.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Less interruptions to development ex: when colleague/s on holidays. Bugs can be fixed with less ambiguity.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Core code is versioned, and reviewed regularly.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Technical debt is minimised.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;glass=0;shadow=0;gradientColor=none;strokeWidth=2;" parent="T5EDZcPU9q_wp7y4ELcz-1" vertex="1">
